<title>USA: Reckson Associates Realty Q4 FFO rises.</title>
<headline>Reckson Associates Realty Q4 FFO rises.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reckson Associates Realty Corp said Wednesday it posted 1996 fourth-quarter funds from operations of $12.4 million, or $0.82 per share, up from $7.5 million, or $0.73 per share, a year earlier.</p>
<p>For the full year, it reported FFO of $41.1 million, or $3.11 per share, on revenues of $96.1 million and income before minority interest and extraordinary items of $24.4 million. In 1995, FFO on a proforma basis was $29.1 million, or $2.82 per share.</p>
<p>Company officials were not available to provide further details.</p>
